{"3230120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zozo and the Lost Dreams", "steam_appid": 3230120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zozo and The Lost Dreams is a casual 2D Metroidvania platformer inspired by classic Saturday-morning cartoons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter Zozo’s Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Zozo, a 13-year-old boy who dreams of becoming a superhero—literally and figuratively. With the help of his mad scientist neighbor, Professor Aisha, Zozo is able to enter his dreams and live out his fantasy of becoming a superhero. However, a strange incident prevents him from waking up! Zozo must now go on an adventure to find his way back home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.poster.avif?t=1788254229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.webm?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.mp4?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Imaginative and Vibrant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re in the mood for scaling mountainous cupcakes or eliminating predatory computer ‘bugs’, each dream has a distinct flavor inspired by various tropes and genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/efe10a08c5607e20cde80d9f70e839d2.poster.avif?t=1788254229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/efe10a08c5607e20cde80d9f70e839d2.webm?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/efe10a08c5607e20cde80d9f70e839d2.mp4?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make New Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend quirky dreamlings and aid them in their hijinks. Work together with a colorful cast of characters to uncover a sinister plot that threatens to take away all of Zozo’s dreams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/10910012d41cf472c41b2a483e9a8f6b.poster.avif?t=1788254229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/10910012d41cf472c41b2a483e9a8f6b.webm?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/10910012d41cf472c41b2a483e9a8f6b.mp4?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zozo and The Lost Dreams is a casual 2D Metroidvania platformer inspired by classic Saturday-morning cartoons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter Zozo’s Dream</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Zozo, a 13-year-old boy who dreams of becoming a superhero—literally and figuratively. With the help of his mad scientist neighbor, Professor Aisha, Zozo is able to enter his dreams and live out his fantasy of becoming a superhero. However, a strange incident prevents him from waking up! Zozo must now go on an adventure to find his way back home.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.poster.avif?t=1788254229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.webm?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/e4d5a4c808ec706b3180d58b362ef34d.mp4?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore Imaginative and Vibrant World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re in the mood for scaling mountainous cupcakes or eliminating predatory computer ‘bugs’, each dream has a distinct flavor inspired by various tropes and genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/efe10a08c5607e20cde80d9f70e839d2.poster.avif?t=1788254229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/efe10a08c5607e20cde80d9f70e839d2.webm?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/efe10a08c5607e20cde80d9f70e839d2.mp4?t=1788254229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make New Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Befriend quirky dreamlings and aid them in their hijinks. Work together with a colorful cast of characters to uncover a sinister plot that threatens to take away all of Zozo’s dreams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/10910012d41cf472c41b2a483e9a8f6b.poster.avif?t=1788254229\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230120/extras/10910012d41cf472c41b2a483e9a8f6b.webm?t=17882542